{{ 'pham-campaign.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{%- capture state_raw -%}{%- render 'pham-campaign-state' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign state = state_raw | strip -%}

<section class="pham-campaign-shell" data-pham-edition-terms>
  <div class="pham-campaign-inner">
    {%- if state == 'prelaunch' -%}<span class="pham-campaign-draft">PRELAUNCH DRAFT · LEGAL REVIEW REQUIRED BEFORE PAYMENT GOES LIVE</span>{%- endif -%}
    <p class="pham-campaign-kicker">{{ settings.pham_campaign_edition_label | default: 'EDITION 01' }} · RESERVATION TERMS</p>
    <h1 class="pham-campaign-title">Edition terms.</h1>
    <p class="pham-campaign-lede">Pre-order and customization terms for Edition 01. Read together with PHAM's <a href="/policies/terms-of-service">Terms of service</a>, <a href="/policies/privacy-policy">Privacy policy</a>, <a href="/policies/refund-policy">Refund policy</a> and <a href="/policies/shipping-policy">Shipping policy</a>. Applicable mandatory consumer rights take precedence if any clause conflicts with local law.</p>

    <div class="pham-campaign-grid">
      <article class="pham-campaign-card pham-campaign-card--full">
        <h2>1 · PHAM-001 jacket deposit</h2>
        <p>The {{ settings.pham_campaign_reservation_price | default: '$24.99' }} deposit is an initial payment toward one {{ settings.pham_campaign_final_price | default: '$199.00' }} PHAM-001 jacket, not a separate access fee. The deposit is credited to the jacket price. A confirmed deposit records an allocation subject to payment confirmation, edition capacity, fraud review and the final terms disclosed at checkout.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="pham-campaign-card pham-campaign-card--full">
        <h2>2 · Digital lookbook</h2>
        <p>{% if settings.pham_campaign_include_digital_lookbook %}After confirmed reservation payment, PHAM intends to deliver the {{ settings.pham_campaign_digital_lookbook_label | default: 'edition-exclusive digital lookbook' }} electronically. Checkout must obtain any consent required for immediate digital-content delivery. Delivery of digital content does not remove statutory cancellation, refund or consumer rights where applicable law provides otherwise.{% else %}No digital reservation benefit is currently configured for this edition.{% endif %}</p>
      </article>

      <article class="pham-campaign-card pham-campaign-card--full">
        <h2>3 · Remaining balance</h2>
        <p>When the acquisition window opens, a reserved collector is expected to receive a request for the remaining product balance of {{ settings.pham_campaign_balance_due | default: '$174.01' }}. Shipping, taxes and duties may be added at checkout according to destination and applicable rules. The planned payment window is {{ settings.pham_campaign_payment_window_hours | default: 72 }} hours. If the balance is not paid within the valid window, PHAM may release the allocation, subject to applicable law and the final published terms.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="pham-campaign-card pham-campaign-card--full">
        <h2>4 · Deposits, cancellations and refunds</h2>
        <p>The deposit is part of the jacket purchase price rather than an independent access fee. Customers may request cancellation or correction by emailing <a href="mailto:contact@phamofficial.com?subject=PHAM%20Edition%2001%20order%20request">contact@phamofficial.com</a> with their order number. The refund decision depends on order status, the <a href="/policies/refund-policy">published refund policy</a> and mandatory consumer rights; paying a deposit does not waive those rights. If PHAM cancels the edition or cannot supply the promised jacket, PHAM will return payments for the unfulfilled order in accordance with applicable law. No deposit is automatically forfeited merely because a listed production estimate changes.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="pham-campaign-card pham-campaign-card--full">
        <h2>5 · Object Identity</h2>
        <p>Object Identity privileges are limited across both paid upgrades and referral unlocks. The paid Identity upgrade is a separate add-on and is not part of the reservation credit applied to the object price. Preferred object numbers are not final until server-side allocation confirms the number. The customer may request a printed name (up to 24 characters), an inscription (up to 40 characters), and optional private printing instructions (up to 240 characters). Printing instructions do not guarantee custom artwork, a new card format or a technically impossible finish. PHAM may contact the customer to verify spelling and production feasibility before committing an engraving. Changes after production begins may not be possible. Buyers with an eligible Identity entitlement must contact PHAM via the email link or the configured official WhatsApp channel on the Object Identity page to submit their desired card text and production notes. Clicking the channel opens a prefilled message; the customer must actually send it. No identity data, preferred number or production request is recorded from this page automatically. PHAM will review the correspondence, verify the order, and confirm the number and engraving before production. The on-screen preview is illustrative, not a final production proof.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="pham-campaign-card pham-campaign-card--full">
        <h2>6 · Free standby</h2>
        <p>After paid reservations reach the edition allocation, further customers may join a free standby queue. A promoted standby customer pays the full {{ settings.pham_campaign_final_price | default: '$199.00' }} because no reservation credit was previously paid. Queue and offer-window rules are subject to the final campaign terms.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="pham-campaign-card pham-campaign-card--full">
        <h2>7 · Production and delivery record</h2>
        <p>After final acquisition is confirmed, the object may move through production, quality control, packing, dispatch and delivery stages shown in Collector Access. These stages are operational records, not guaranteed delivery dates. As a planning indication only, the reservation window may run for up to 14 days and manufacturing can take approximately 35–50 days after PHAM authorizes production, plus quality control and shipping; customers may therefore wait longer than 50 days after their deposit. Carrier tracking controls the shipment estimate once the object is dispatched. Any published production or delivery estimate remains subject to the final order terms, destination, customs and events outside PHAM’s reasonable control.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="pham-campaign-card pham-campaign-card--full">
        <h2>8 · Founder’s Token</h2>
        <p>Edition 01 is intended to include 50 collector tokens: 49 silver-tone and one gold-tone finish. Token finish does not change ownership rights in the PHAM object and PHAM does not promise a resale, investment or cash value. The allocation mechanism and any related public promotion require final jurisdictional legal review before launch; where applicable law requires a different mechanism or disclosure, PHAM may amend this part of the edition protocol before reservations open.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="pham-campaign-card pham-campaign-card--full">
        <h2>9 · Your design and personalization data</h2>
        <p>PHAM uses the chosen number, card name, inscription and production instructions to process an eligible collector's customization request and manufacture the associated item. Special instructions are private and are not published in the Object Record. Public display of an alias is optional and is off unless expressly selected. Do not submit addresses, contact numbers, medical details, ID documents or other sensitive data in the instructions box. Collector records and lawful data requests are handled under the <a href="/policies/privacy-policy">Privacy policy</a>; requests to access, correct or delete eligible personal information may be sent to <a href="mailto:contact@phamofficial.com">contact@phamofficial.com</a>.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="pham-campaign-card pham-campaign-card--full">
        <h2>10 · Cross-border purchases and withdrawal</h2>
        <p>Taxes, import duties and any additional destination charges are displayed or allocated according to the shipping and checkout terms, and local rules may apply. Where a statutory withdrawal or cancellation right applies, PHAM honors it. Eligible EU distance purchases generally have a 14-day withdrawal right, subject to statutory exceptions for genuinely made-to-specification or clearly personalized goods and certain digital content. Selecting a preferred object number or submitting a request does not automatically remove a customer's legal rights. Customers may send an unambiguous withdrawal request with the order number to <a href="/pages/contact?request=withdrawal">online withdrawal request form</a> or by email to <a href="mailto:contact@phamofficial.com?subject=Withdrawal%20request">contact@phamofficial.com</a>; PHAM will acknowledge and apply the rights relevant to the specific order and jurisdiction.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="pham-campaign-card pham-campaign-card--full">
        <h2>11 · Production changes and transparent updates</h2>
        <p>PHAM will make reasonable efforts to communicate substantial specification changes, material production delays, or an inability to fulfill orders using the contact details provided at checkout. The displayed design may be an approved prototype or representative editorial image; material differences from the final garment must be disclosed before purchase and material substitutions must not silently change the essential product ordered. If a proposed change is material, PHAM will contact affected customers and provide the remedy required by applicable law.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="pham-campaign-card pham-campaign-card--full">
        <h2>12 · Support and order problems</h2>
        <p>For accessibility assistance, size changes, duplicate charges, invoice questions, delivery concerns, withdrawals and personalization corrections, email <a href="mailto:contact@phamofficial.com">contact@phamofficial.com</a>. Include your order or reservation reference, but never send payment card details by email. PHAM's general policies and applicable mandatory consumer protections remain in force. Unresolved legal or production issues must be resolved before paid reservations are enabled.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

